<title>UK: Dorrell to announce he quitting Tory race.</title>
<headline>Dorrell to announce he quitting Tory race.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former health secretary Stephen Dorrell will anounce later on Wednesday that he is quitting the race for the leadership of the Conservative Party, the Press Association reported.</p>
</text>
